    "created_at": "2024-09-05T10:22:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-09-05T10:22:05Z",
    "body": "Same usecase here: you'd want consumers of web components not having to know the details of how the web component was implemented, but just do what they normally do and things to 'just' work\r\n\r\nSo if they want to style all required form elements, that they can just use the :required pseudo-selector, instead of having to figure out for all the custom elements they might be using (now, but also in the future) how to properly target them using component-specific selectors ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
